# Fecund Greenshell (4/6 Reach, {3}{G}{G}): "Whenever this creature or another creature you control with toughness greater than its
# power enters, look at the top card of your library. If it's a land card, you may put it onto the battlefield tapped. Otherwise,
# put it into your hand." Black Lotus ({G}{G}{G}), Mox Emerald and Mox Jet pay for it on turn 1 (the Mox Pearl pays for the
# next creature). The Greenshell itself enters (toughness 6 > power 4) and the Forest on top is put onto the battlefield tapped
# (accepted). Devoted Hero (1/2: toughness greater by one) enters and the next Forest is declined: it goes into the hand,
# not back on top (Bloomburrow release notes: "If the top card of your library is a land card, you may choose to put it into your
# hand rather than onto the battlefield tapped"). Memnite (1/1, toughness equal to power) does not trigger it: the Lightning Bolt
# stays on top.

